package andromeda:snapshot-template@0.1.0;

/// Snapshot-template plugin category — **non-UI**. Emits curated markdown
/// for paste-to-AI workflows; no DOM emission imports.
///
/// **Accessibility:** not applicable at this boundary. The snapshot-template
/// category output is markdown text consumed by the user via clipboard /
/// file paste into an AI debug session; not rendered as host UI. A11y
/// obligations attach to UI-emitting categories only (custom-dashboard).
///
/// **Security posture:** plugin receives a JSON-serialized `SnapshotInput`
/// (curation primitives output from `crates/snapshot/`) and returns markdown
/// text bounded by the host's token budget (10k / 25k / 50k per snapshot-plan
/// §Token Budget). Output is NEVER logged verbatim — clipboard hygiene per
/// security plan §Logging Vector 5.
world snapshot-template {
    /// Plugin's render entry point. Called by the host when the user
    /// invokes Investigate via the curation pipeline. `input` is a
    /// JSON-encoded SnapshotInput; `output` on success is markdown text
    /// within token budget; `error` on failure is a sanitized one-liner.
    export render: func(input: string) -> result<string, string>;
}
